{"id":"n66472-1-9","stage":5,"title":"쓸모 · 用途","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66472-1-9-1","ko":"요새 왜 이렇게 수업에 흥미가 없어?","zh":"最近怎么对上课这么没兴趣啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요새","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","explanation":"이렇게：“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","readings":[{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71156","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수업에","meaning":"授课，讲课","explanation":"수업：授课，讲课；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"수업","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64597","senseId":"1","lemma":"수업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흥미가","meaning":"兴趣，兴致，兴味","explanation":"흥미：兴趣，兴致，兴味；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"흥미","audio":"/audio/ebc97471b0d0dde777bc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73255","senseId":"1","lemma":"흥미","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"11","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"9a767a1c9118d82c","term":"이렇게","zh":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3","entryId":"71156","definition":"“이러하게(这样，这么)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"01c1761e85dc638b","term":"수업","zh":"授课，讲课","audio":"/audio/01c1761e85dc638b63f3.mp3","entryId":"64597","definition":"教师教学生知识或技术。","pronunciation":["수업"]},{"id":"ebc97471b0d0dde7","term":"흥미","zh":"兴趣，兴致，兴味","audio":"/audio/ebc97471b0d0dde777bc.mp3","entryId":"73255","definition":"令人倾心的趣味。","pronunciation":["흥ː미"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不具有某物，或不具备资格、能力。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/fbb5f32c7b3ae846ed6c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66472-1-9-2","ko":"지금 배우는 이론들이 정말 쓸모가 있는 것들인지 모르겠어.","zh":"不确定现在学的这些理论到底有没有用。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在","explanation":"지금：现在","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62522","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배우는","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이론들이","meaning":"理论","explanation":"이론：理论；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이론","audio":"/audio/51c70939de724c529cb1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71741","senseId":"1","lemma":"이론","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸모가","meaning":"用途，用处，用场","explanation":"쓸모：用途，用处，用场；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"쓸모","audio":"/audio/e7abf572049bad25cad1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66472","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓸모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것들인지","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모르겠어.","meaning":"不知道，不确定，也许","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不确定，也许；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"5","lemma":"모르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62522","definition":"指正在说话的此时。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"51c70939de724c52","term":"이론","zh":"理论","audio":"/audio/51c70939de724c529cb1.mp3","entryId":"71741","definition":"把某种道理或知识有逻辑性地一般化的命题体系。","pronunciation":["이ː론"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"e7abf572049bad25","term":"쓸모","zh":"用途，用处，用场","audio":"/audio/e7abf572049bad25cad1.mp3","entryId":"66472","definition":"值得使用的价值。","pronunciation":["쓸모"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"20ef19694f337fd4","term":"모르다","zh":"不知道，不确定，也许","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3","entryId":"29712","definition":"推测或猜测不确定的事宜。","pronunciation":["모ː르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b31af5a9e4135b35e24.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.462,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66472","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":166,"sequenceScore":3.2887,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不确定现在学的这些理论到底有没有用。","最近怎么对上课这么没兴趣啊？","真不明白，这个地区的房价怎么会这么贵啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["最近怎么对上课这么没兴趣啊？","真不明白，这个地区的房价怎么会这么贵啊。","不确定现在学的这些理论到底有没有用。"],"answer":2}]}
